Privacy Policy — OpenClaw Agent (personal use)

This application is a private, single-user tool operated by and for
Frederick Penny. It is not offered to the public, has no other users,
and does not collect data from anyone else.

Information accessed: with the account owner's explicit consent, the app
reads Gmail messages (read-only), and reads/writes Google Calendar events
and Drive/Docs/Sheets/Slides files belonging to that same account.

How it is used: data is used only to perform tasks the owner requests
(e.g. reading a confirmation email, updating a calendar event location).
Nothing is sold, shared, or transferred to any third party.

Storage: OAuth credentials are stored locally on the owner's own
computer. Message and file content is processed in memory to complete
the owner's requests and is not retained on any external server.

Contact: frederick.g.penny@gmail.com
